    "$comment": "Google Fonts, latin-ext subset (Ğ Ş İ ı Ç Ö Ü). fontDisplay (serif) ONLY for display, h1, record names, KPI values and report headings; never in tables, forms or buttons. Numbers use tabular figures (font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums). Never below 13px except eyebrow (12px uppercase).",
